  "title": "Chocolate Chip Peppermint Cookies",
  "description": "A chocolaty chocolate chip cookie, with peppermint flavoring. This is for kids or adults (I’m a 10 year old.) They taste best when they’re still hot.",
  "authors": [
    "Courtney"
  ],
